{"id":"1f15e62b2f077e8d","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-substitution-term.md","title":"Term Substitution","display":"df-substitution-term — Term Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-substitution-term","aliases":["58-df-substitution-term"],"display":"df-substitution-term — Term Substitution","depends_on":["[[58-df-term]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-substitution-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-substitution-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-substitution-term — Term Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"58-df-term\">58-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span> (first-order signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_k:k\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_k:k\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> (variable set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (term set for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span> (original term)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (被替换的变量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span> (replacement term)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:T\\to T\">\\(\\sigma:T\\to T\\)</span> (candidate substitution map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TermSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TermSet}_S\\)</span> (term-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"58-df-term\">58-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S\\)</span> (term-substitution predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[s/x]\">\\(t[s/x]\\)</span> (term substitution operation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S,T,x,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TermSet}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land s\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,T)\\land\\sigma(x)=s\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}\\;(\\sigma(v)=v)\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\sigma(c)=c)\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in T^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\to\\sigma(\\langle f,u\\rangle)=\\langle f,\\langle\\sigma(u(i)):i&lt;n\\rangle\\rangle\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S,T,x,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TermSet}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land s\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,T)\\land\\sigma(x)=s\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}\\;(\\sigma(v)=v)\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\sigma(c)=c)\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall u\\in T^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\to\\sigma(\\langle f,u\\rangle)=\\langle f,\\langle\\sigma(u(i)):i&lt;n\\rangle\\rangle\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S,T,x,s)\\land t\\in T\\to t[s/x]=\\sigma(t)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S,T,x,s)\\land t\\in T\\to t[s/x]=\\sigma(t)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>项替换按项树递归定义：变量被替换，常量不变，函数应用逐坐标递归替换。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[s/x]\">\\(t[s/x]\\)</span> 表示将项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 中所有出现的变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 替换为项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的结果</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}(t)\\)</span> 提取项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 中出现的变量集合</li>\n<li>替换合成律及其变量条件属于下游引理。</li>\n<li>Variable support <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}(t)\\)</span> is a separate recursive operation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"db7ec154138d5972\" href=\"?note=db7ec154138d5972\" title=\"58-df-term\">58-df-term</a> — 项</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"58-df-substitution-formula\">58-df-substitution-formula</a> — 公式替换</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ad179c98b9a237c\" href=\"?note=8ad179c98b9a237c\" title=\"58-df-free-for\">58-df-free-for</a> — 自由度条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TermSet}_S$ (term-set predicate, see [[58-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (three-place function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]] — 一阶公式","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"db7ec154138d5972","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-term]] — 项","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"60d957ce43061cb6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-substitution-formula]] — 公式替换","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-for","status":"resolved","id":"8ad179c98b9a237c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[58-df-free-for]] — 自由度条件","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_k:k\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in \\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:T\\to T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TermSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t[s/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S,T,x,s)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal L=\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{TermSet}_S(T,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land s\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\sigma,T,T)\\land\\sigma(x)=s\\land\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}\\;(\\sigma(v)=v)\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;(\\sigma(c)=c)\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall u\\in T^n\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ar}(f)=n\\to\\sigma(\\langle f,u\\rangle)=\\langle f,\\langle\\sigma(u(i)):i<n\\rangle\\rangle\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}substitution\\text{-}term\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\mathrm{TermSubstitution}_S(\\sigma,\\mathcal L,\\mathrm{Var}_S,T,x,s)\\land t\\in T\\to t[s/x]=\\sigma(t)","display":true},{"tex":"t[s/x]","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}(t)","display":false}],"bytes":2294,"backlinks":[{"id":"60d957ce43061cb6","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-substitution-term.md]] — 项替换"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-substitution-term.md|58-df-substitution-term]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["db7ec154138d5972","36d7463d215be751","65418b505fc53093","60d957ce43061cb6","8ad179c98b9a237c"]}